":118.27999877929688},{"end":125.76000213623047,"text":"You better know that it takes more to be more to be there","start":123.44000244140625},{"end":139.6199951171875,"text":"I gotta breathe when you're on fire Touchin' me there","start":128.44000244140625},{"end":148.13999938964844,"text":"Yeah, I gotta know you're comin' home Gotta know, is it just another time and now?","start":139.6199951171875},{"end":154.66000366210938,"text":"Fallin' out of place, fallin' into place Same reaction, lost it, out of space","start":148.13999938964844},{"end":162.10000610351562,"text":"Asinine flyin' in a nautical wave Gettin' high and you thought that you wouldn't behave","start":154.8800048828125},{"end":169.36000061035156,"text":"Break your face down with astamine Demon's inside, man, we're all the same","start":162.10000610351562},{"end":177.94000244140625,"text":"Don't be lookin' at me, don't be lookin' at me When your day comes to an end","start":169.36000061035156},{"end":187.16000366210938,"text":"Remember, it's all just a different kind of blue When you're blue, when you're high","start":180.60000610351562},{"end":199.16000366210938,"text":"All in mind, just left behind You knew, you flew, you said goodbye","start":188.16000366210938},{"end":210.3000030517578,"text":"Tonight, my son, you and me Are you here, are you feelin'","start":200.17999267578125},{"end":215.3800048828125,"text":"Have you covered, lost it all, it's dead","start":210.3000030517578},{"end":224.3000030517578,"text":"Come back home again Come back home and see all","start":217.4199981689453},{"end":232.16000366210938,"text":"Lost and regretted, timeline in a mess Lost and regrets, it's all an affair","start":225},{"end":237.55999755859375,"text":"Don't know why I even took so many years To think about a dream that was a loss","start":232.16000366210938},{"end":243.4199981689453,"text":"And every kid who came could come around Fuck it all, that's what I said","start":237.55999755859375},{"end":250.940002